CREATED:20230130T212409Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>The most dramatic worship service of the year!  Join uson
  <strong><span>Thursday\,April 18 at 7:30pm</span></strong> for our <strong
 ><span>Maundy Thursday worship service</span></strong>.  <span>The word mau
 ndy is derived from the Latin mandatum which meanscommandment.  Jesus' comm
 andment was to love one another\, and we do thisby <strong><span>washingof 
 feet </span></strong></span>and <strong><span>sharing a Eucharistic meal</s
 pan></strong>. </span><p><span>The conclusion of the service is the <strong
 ><span>dramatic stripping of thealtar</span></strong> and the <strong><span
 >processionof the reserved sacrament</span></strong> into our historic Chap
 el. We also keep vigil all night during our <strong><span>night watch</span
 ></strong> whichconcludes on the morning of Good Friday.</span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:MAUNDY THURSDAY
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
