DESCRIPTION:<span>On Sunday\, January 15\, 2023 at both the 8am and 10am se
 rvices we will <b><span>celebrate the life and legacy of The Rev. Dr. Marti
 n Luther King\, Jr</span></b>.<span> </span>We will listen to a portion of 
 his August 28\,1963 <b><span>"I Have A Dream Speech"</span></b> during both
  Eucharists.<span> </span>Be inspired by this faithful man who fought hard 
 for civil rights\, and is a true saint of our time.</span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dr. Martin Luther King\, Jr. Tribute
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
