DESCRIPTION:<span>On Palm Sunday (April 13\, 2025) we will offer two servic
 es\, both in-person or online. The 8am Worship Service in the Chapel will e
 nd in silence with the stripping of the altar. Our 10am Worship Service beg
 ins on our front lawn (weather permitting) with a <b><span>grand procession
 </span></b> where everyone marches around and in the Church. The service<b>
 <span> begins with triumph</span></b> and <b><span>ends with contemplation<
 /span></b>. Both services conclude with the reading of <b><span>The Passion
 </span></b> story\, with no dismissal and leaving in silence.</span>
