DESCRIPTION:<p><span>Join us for our <b><span>Vigil Celebration of Easter</
 span></b> on the eve before (<b><span>Saturday\, April 8</span></b>) <b><sp
 an>at 7:30pm</span></b> when we light the<b><span> new fire</span></b> and 
 experience the move <b><span>from darkness into light</span></b>. The servi
 ce begins in the center of our outdoor <b><span>labyrinth</span></b>\, and 
 then all process into the darkened church where each attendee lights a <b><
 span>candle</span></b> from the new flame.</span></p><p><b><span>Stories</s
 pan></b><span> of the church through modern times are heard\, and we celebr
 ate <b><span>Eucharist</span></b> once more. After the service join us for 
 some <b><span>breads and champagne</span></b> in our Fellowship Hall. <i><s
 pan>Jesus Christ is risen today! Alleluia! Alleluia! Alleluia!</span></i></
 span></p>
