 king members to</span><b><span> bring in photos</span></b><span><span> </sp
 an></span><span>of any mom\, grandma\, aunt\, female figure\, etc.</span><s
 pan> you would like to<span><b> </b></span><b><span>celebrate for Mothers' 
 Day</span></b><span> </span>this year.</span><p><span>We will display the p
 hotos of these special women on tables in front of the altar\,</span><span>
  and hold them in prayer during the<span> </span><b><span>10amWorship</span
 ></b>.</span></p><p><span>In addition\, the Sunday School students (and Pra
 yer Shawl Ministry) will have a<span> </span><b><span>surprise</span></b><s
 pan> </span>in store for all women in attendance at the 10am service.</span
 ></p><p><b><span><span> </span></span></b></p>
