 </b> where everyone marches around and in the Church. The service<b><span> 
 begins with triumph</span></b> and <b><span>ends with contemplation</span><
 /b>. Both services conclude with the reading of <b><span>The Passion</span>
 </b> story\, with no dismissal and leaving in silence.</span>
