  at the Verona Public Library\, 17 Gould Street\, in the Jack Foley Meeting
  Room.<br><p><b><span>For moreinformation:</span></b><b> </b><span>Contact 
 any of the clergy leaders atthe participating houses of worship: <b>FirstPr
 esbyterian Church of Verona<span>\, IslamicCenter of Verona</span></b>\, <b
 >Our Lady ofthe Lake Roman Catholic Church</b>\,<b> </b>the<b> Episcopal Ch
 urch of the Holy Spirit</b><span>\, </span><b>B’naiShalom West Orange</b><s
 pan>\, </span><b>Calvary Lutheran Church </b><span>and</span><b> First Cong
 regational Church of Verona</b><span>.</span></span><b></b></p>
