DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20221106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20221107
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:17hsmqstnfe92n9rag739avf7q@google.com
CREATED:20221110T035019Z
DESCRIPTION:At Holy Spirit Verona we share in&nbsp\;<strong><b>three weeks 
 of "Pre-Advent"</b></strong>&nbsp\;-- the three Sundays between All Saints 
 and Advent 1.&nbsp\; During this time we&nbsp\;encourage&nbsp\;you to take 
 an intentional “pause” before the waiting and preparing of Advent.&nbsp\; A
 dvent used to be seven weeks\, up until the 7<span>th</span>&nbsp\;century\
 , and there is a small movement within the Church to return to that (see&nb
 sp\;<a href="http://www.theadventproject.org/"><b>theadventproject.org</b><
 /a>).&nbsp\; Many of the scripture readings and prayers after&nbsp\;All Sai
 nts&nbsp\;give a hint or lean&nbsp\;towards Advent\, so Father Jerry&nbsp\;
 says...<span>&nbsp\;</span><em><i>why not just go there!</i></em><p>Yes\, w
 e all know Father Jerry loves Advent.&nbsp\; We are not bringing forth Chri
 stmas early like many retailers do\, but rather allowing&nbsp\;<strong><b>a
 n intentional time to PAUSE</b></strong>&nbsp\;before the all-consuming mon
 th of December. &nbsp\;These three weeks of Pre-Advent\, we&nbsp\;hope\, wi
 ll bring forth a level of preparation and space during Advent which will ma
 ke Christmas that much more meaningful.&nbsp\; Our first experience of Pre-
 Advent was in 2018\, so it's now officially a tradition!&nbsp\; We get to s
 ee&nbsp\;the blue hangings\, which are symbolic of the Blessed Mother\, for
  just a few extra weeks.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<strong><b>Find some space</b></stron
 g>&nbsp\;these next three weeks to do something that will set you up well f
 or the entrance of the Christ-child into our midst yet again.&nbsp\;<em><i>
 &nbsp\;Join us&nbsp\;as we prepare to prepare!</i></em></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PRE-ADVENT BEGINS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
