DESCRIPTION:The *official* first Sunday of Advent begins the Christian Chur
 ch's<strong><b><span>&nbsp\;</span>new calendar year</b></strong>. &nbsp\;H
 appy New Year! &nbsp\;This year we move&nbsp\;to<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong
 ><b>Year A</b></strong>\, using the Gospel of Matthew&nbsp\;for most Sunday
 s.&nbsp\;<p>The traditional color of Advent is<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong><
 b>purple</b></strong>\; however\, the more contemporary color is<span>&nbsp
 \;</span><strong><b>blue</b></strong><span>&nbsp\;</span>as a tribute to th
 e role of the Blessed Mother\, Mary. &nbsp\;Join us in the Sundays of Adven
 t as we<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong><b>wait in expectancy</b></strong><span>
 &nbsp\;</span>for the Christ-child once again.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FIRST SUNDAY IN ADVENT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
