DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260503
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260504
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:7uj05v1i0qn6nbvu798qonvn1n@google.com
CREATED:20260319T020319Z
DESCRIPTION:On <b>Sunday\, May 3</b> we will celebrate our fourth <b>"Holy 
 Communion\, Not First" during the 10am service </b>in recent memory. Our Su
 nday School students will be learning more about the Eucharist during class
 es in the month of April. Because the Episcopal Church sees Baptism as the 
 only sacrament of initiation into the Christian Church\, <b>children may re
 ceive the bread and wine at any time.</b> We typically allow parents to dec
 ide the right timing for their children. For some families having a formal 
 "milestone" marking of Holy Eucharist is important\; so we will once again 
 celebrate what Father Jerry names "Holy Communion\, Not First." <b>At least
  two students will be participating</b> in this beautiful ritual and will s
 tand at altar on Sunday\, May 3 along with our clergy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T233939Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HOLY COMMUNION\, NOT FIRST
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
