 ========================= <br> <br>We will once again be visiting <b><a hre
 f="https://gracehouse.dioswva.org/" target="_blank">Grace House on the Moun
 tain</a></b> in <b>St. Paul\, VA</b> for a Mission Trip. Attendees must be 
 <b>at least</b> <b>entering high school</b> in the Fall of 2024 with guardi
 an completion (if under age 18) of required paperwork. Fee (accommodations\
 , meals\, transportation\, etc.) is $500. <b>Deposit of $200 is due by May 
 1</b>. Two required <b>pre-trip meetings</b> will be scheduled in May. Fina
 l payment is due June 12. <b>Application forms</b> are <a href="http://weeb
 ly-file/1/4/2/4/142411498/youthmissiontrip2024_cohs_forms.pdf" target="_bla
 nk">available here</a> or in Fellowship Hall. Scholarship money is availabl
 e. For more information\, email Fr. Jerry at <a href="mailto:rector@holyspi
 ritverona.org" target="_blank">rector@holyspiritverona.org</a>.
