DESCRIPTION:<span>Join us on<span> Sunday\, April 12 </span>as we "</span><
 span><span>flower</span></span><span> the cross</span><span>\," turning a s
 ymbol of pain and suffering into one of rebirth and renewal. <b><span>Pleas
 e bring any type of </span></b><span><b>flower</b></span><b><span> or green
 ery</span></b>.</span><p><span>While some churches "<span>flower</span> the
  cross" on Easter <span>Sunday</span>\, it's been a long tradition at Holy 
 Spirit to embrace this tradition on the <b><span>Second </span></b><span><b
 >Sunday</b></span><b><span> of Easter</span></b>.</span></p><p><span>At the
  end of the service\, we'll bring the cross outside as further witness that
  <b><span>Christ is Risen!</span></b> <i><span>Alleluia! Alleluia! Alleluia
 !</span></i></span></p>
