CREATED:20250120T154636Z
DESCRIPTION:We will celebrate The <b>Feast of The Presentation of Jesus in 
 the Temple</b> on Sunday\, February 2. The roles of the prophets Simeon (th
 ink Nunc dimittis in Evening Prayer) and Anna are emphasized on this day.  
 A female prophet? YES! Her name is Anna\, and she was an 84-year old widow 
 when Jesus was brought to the temple as an infant. #wisewoman  #candlemas  
 #nuncdimittis<br><br>Both Anna and Simeon\, who exclaimed\, "my eyes have s
 een Your salvation\," recognized that this baby would be redemption of the 
 world. Come hear about this milestone in Jesus' story and learn its signifi
 cance for us today.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FEAST OF THE PRESENTATION
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
