DTEND:20241116T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:2i52207h9igtcrmgj9c1qj6i87@google.com
CREATED:20240904T183343Z
DESCRIPTION:On <b>Saturday\, November 16</b> the group will meet from <b>12
 pm to 3pm</b> instead of the usual morning hour.<br> <br>==================
 ======================================================== <br> <br>On the fo
 llowing <span>Saturdays (every other week) -- <b>November 2\, 16\, 30 and D
 ecember 14</b></span><b> -- from 9am to 12pm</b> in our Fellowship Hall\, w
 e will host a <b>Centering Prayer Introductory Workshop</b>. Centering Pray
 er is a form of Contemplative Prayer\, opening our hearts and minds to God\
 , the Ultimate Mystery\, beyond any thoughts\, words and feelings. It is a 
 prayer in silence\, which we believe to be God’s first language. This four-
 part workshop will be led by <b>Deacon Joanne O’Neill</b>.<br><b>Sign-up</b
 > in the Fellowship Hall. <i>Plan to attend and bring a friend!</i><br> <br
 >“Be still and know that I am God.”  <i>Psalm 46:10 ~~ </i>"I am with you a
 lways."  <i>Matthew 28:20</i><br> If you have any questions\, or want to jo
 in\, contact <a href="mailto:rector@holyspiritverona.org" target="_blank">F
 ather Jerry</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Centering Prayer Introductory Workshop\, Part 2
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
