 od at the foot of the cross.<span> </span>It is an hour of short readings a
 nd music to help us spiritually as we move into the sacred Triduum that is 
 Holy Week. </span><i><span>All are welcome.</span></i><br><i><span> </span>
 </i><br><span>This year\, this program will be offered in-person AND online
