 ne\, use this information:</span><br><span>Via computer\, laptop\, PC\, tab
 let\, smartphone\, etc. --</span><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/8944498
 5198">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89444985198</a><br><span>Via telephone (aud
