UID:2jldle3eeud0o8vru98oln8p9c@google.com
CREATED:20250927T211526Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span>Join us for our <b><span>Vigil Celebration of Easter</
 span></b> on the eve before (<b><span>Saturday\, April 4\, 2026</span></b>)
  <b><span>at 7:30pm</span></b> when we light the<b><span> new fire</span></
 b> and experience the move <b><span>from darkness into light</span></b>. Th
 e service begins in the center of our outdoor <b><span>labyrinth</span></b>
 \, and then all process into the darkened church where each attendee lights
  a <b><span>candle</span></b> from the new flame.</span></p><p><b><span>Sto
 ries</span></b><span> of the church through modern times are heard\, and we
  celebrate <b><span>Eucharist</span></b> once more. After the service join 
 us for some <b><span>breads and champagne</span></b> in our Fellowship Hall
 . <i><span>Jesus Christ is risen today! Alleluia! Alleluia! Alleluia!</span
 ></i></span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Easter Vigil (in-person only)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
