DESCRIPTION:<p><span>Join us for our <b><span>Vigil Celebration of Easter</
 span></b> on the eve before (<b><span>Saturday\, March 30</span></b>) <b><s
 pan>at 7:30pm</span></b> when we light the<b><span> new fire</span></b> and
  experience the move <b><span>from darkness into light</span></b>. The serv
 ice begins in the center of our outdoor <b><span>labyrinth</span></b>\, and
  then all process into the darkened church where each attendee lights a <b>
 <span>candle</span></b> from the new flame.</span></p><p><b><span>Stories</
 span></b><span> of the church through modern times are heard\, and we celeb
 rate <b><span>Eucharist</span></b> once more. After the service join us for
  some <b><span>breads and champagne</span></b> in our Fellowship Hall. <i><
 span>Jesus Christ is risen today! Alleluia! Alleluia! Alleluia!</span></i><
 /span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Easter Vigil (in-person only)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
