 his information:</span><br><span>Via computer\, laptop\, PC\, tablet\, smar
 tphone\, etc. -- </span><span><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/8322318040
 2"><span>https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83223180402</span></a></span><br><span>V
 ia telephone (audio only) -- (646) 876-9923</span><br><span>Meeting ID: 832
