DESCRIPTION:<span>On Sunday\, October 22\, we kick off our<b><span> Steward
 ship Campaign</span></b>.<span> </span>This is the time of year when we eac
 h <b><span>recommit</span></b> our <b><span>time\, talent and treasure </sp
 an></b>to the Holy Spirit Community.<span> </span>This year’s theme <b><spa
 n>"Rooted in Abundance" </span></b>is an opportunity to be <b><span>reminde
 d of the many gifts God has given us in abundance.</span></b>"<span> </span
 >We show our thanks by </span><i><b><span>sharing our gifts</span></b></i><
 span> with each other and the world.</span><p><span>We are each encouraged 
 to evaluate the abundance we see in our daily lives.<span> </span>How can I
  share God's abundance with those around me?<span> </span>Where do I see Go
 d's gifts in this community and how do I share them with Holy Spirit Verona
  and beyond? </span></p><p><u><span>Stewardship 2023-24 Timeline</span></u>
 <span>:</span></p><p><span>Sundays\, September 17 - November 26 -<b><span> 
 Gospel Themed Inserts </span></b>in Sunday Bulletin (or online)</span></p><
 p><span>Sunday\, October 22 - <b><span>Kick-Off</span></b>/ </span><span><b
 ><span><a href="https://www.holyspiritverona.org/uploads/1/4/2/4/142411498/
 stewardshipforms2024_final.pdf">Re-Commitment Forms</a></span></b></span><s
 pan> Available (electronically and in Church)</span></p><p><span>Sundays\, 
 October 29\, November 2\, 12\, 19 &amp\; 28 - <b><span>stories of members</
 span></b> shared at10am worship</span></p><p><span>Sunday\, November 19 - <
 b><span>In-Giving</span></b> Sunday / <b><span>Re-Commitment Forms Returned
 </span></b></span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:STEWARDSHIP 2023-24 KICK-OFF
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
