 ftar (meal to end Ramadan). This year the event will be at the <b>Islamic C
 enter of Verona</b>\, 56 Grove Avenue\, on <b>Sunday\, March 16 at 6pm</b>.
  The evening will include a short program with each tradition speaking brie
 fly and then a shared meal at sunset. <br><br>Space is limited. To attend t
 he event\, please contact a clergy leader:<br><ul><li>Imam Gazi Aga – info@
 icverona.org --<b>Islamic Center of Verona</b></li><li>Rabbi Robert Tobin -
  rabbitobin@bnaishalom.net -- <b>B’nai Shalom\, West Orange</b></li><li>Pas
 tor Anthony Giordano – ajg0132@gmail.com -- <b>Calvary Lutheran Church</b><
 /li><li>Father Peter Wehrle – pastor@ollverona.org -- <b>Our Lady of the La
 ke Roman Catholic Church</b></li><li>Pastor Jacob Baccus – fccverona.nj@gma
 il.com -- <b>First Congregational Church of Verona</b></li><li>Father Jerry
  Racioppi – rector@holyspiritverona.org** -- <b>Holy Spirit Episcopal Churc
 h</b></li></ul>**Members of the <b>First Presbyterian Church of Verona</b> 
 may contact Father Jerry to attend.
