DESCRIPTION:The Verona Clergy Council is once again hosting an Interfaith I
 ftar (meal to end Ramadan). This year the event will be at the <b>Verona Co
 mmunity Center Ballroom</b>\, 880 Bloomfield Avenue\, on <b>Wednesday\, Mar
 ch 4 at 5:30pm</b>. The evening will include a shared meal at sunset sponso
 red by Peace Island Institute and a short program after the meal. <br><br>S
 pace is limited. To attend the event\, please contact a clergy leader:<br><
 ul><li>Imam Gazi Aga – <a href="mailto:info@icverona.org" target="_blank">i
 nfo@icverona.org</a> --<b>Islamic Center of Verona</b></li><li>Rabbi Robert
  Tobin - <a href="mailto:rabbitobin@bnaishalom.net" target="_blank">rabbito
 bin@bnaishalom.net</a> -- <b>B’nai Shalom\, West Orange</b></li><li>Pastor 
 Anthony Giordano – <a href="mailto:ajg0132@gmail.com" target="_blank">ajg01
 32@gmail.com</a> -- <b>Calvary Lutheran Church</b></li><li>Father Peter Weh
 rle – <a href="mailto:pastor@ollverona.org" target="_blank">pastor@ollveron
 a.org</a> -- <b>Our Lady of the Lake Roman Catholic Church</b></li><li>Past
 or Erik Simon – <span><a href="mailto:erikladdsimon@hotmail.com" target="_b
 lank"><span>erikladdsimon@hotmail.com</span></a></span> -- <b>First Presbyt
 erian Church of Verona</b></li><li>Father Jerry Racioppi – <a href="mailto:
 rector@holyspiritverona.org" target="_blank">rector@holyspiritverona.org</a
 >* -- <b>Holy Spirit Episcopal Church</b></li></ul>*Residents of Verona who
  are not members of any of these congregations may attend by RSVPing to Fat
 her Jerry at Holy Spirit Verona.
