DESCRIPTION:The neighboring Episcopal Church parishes of Christ Church Bloo
 mfield &amp\; Glen Ridge\, Epiphany &amp\; Christ Church Orange and Holy Sp
 irit Verona invite all to share a Lenten journey of fellowship and prayer o
 n the <b>Wednesday evenings of Lent</b>. We will meet each <b>Wednesday at 
 6:30 pm</b> for a simple meal of bread and soup\, followed by a quiet worsh
 ip service.<br><br><span><u>March 12</u> – Epiphany and Christ Church\, 105
  Main Street\, <i>Orange</i></span><br><u>March 19</u> – Church of the Holy
  Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <i>Verona</i><br><u>March 26</u> - Christ Churc
 h\, 74 Park Avenue\, <i>Glen Ridge</i><br><u>April 2</u> – <span><span> Epi
 phany and Christ Church\, 105 Main Street\, <i>Orange</i></span></span><br>
 <u>April 9</u> - <span>Church of the Holy Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <i>Ver
 ona</i><u> </u></span><br><u>April 16</u> - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\
 , <i>Glen Ridge</i> [This service will be a Healing Eucharist as it is Holy
  Week.]<br> <br><b><i>Together they devoted themselves to the apostles’ tea
 ching and fellowship\, to the breaking of bread and prayers.</i></b><b> Act
 s 2:42</b><br><b> </b><br>For more information visit: <a href="https://chri
 stchurchepiscopal.org/" target="_blank"><b>https://christchurchepiscopal.or
 g/</b></a><b> OR </b><a href="https://eaccorange.org/" target="_blank"><b>h
 ttps://eaccorange.org/</b></a><b> OR </b><a href="https://www.holyspiritver
 ona.org/" target="_blank"><b>https://www.holyspiritverona.org/</b></a><b>.<
 /b>
