CREATED:20251214T002307Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>The General Convention of The Episcopal Church approved r
 esolution 2022-B004\,<span> </span><b><b>“Foundation of Religious Life Sund
 ay\,”</b></b><span> </span>to be held each year on the<span> </span><b><b>3
 </b></b></span><b><b>rd</b></b><span><b><b><span> </span>Sunday of Epiphany
 </b></b>. This Sunday focuses efforts to tell all Episcopalians that<span> 
 </span><b><b>residential monastic and dispersed Christian communities</b></
 b><span> </span>exist\, who we are\, and how to connect with us.</span><br>
 <span><br>We at Holy Spirit Verona will mark this day on <b>Sunday\, Januar
 y 25\, 2026 -- </b>and hear from both Rev. Katherine and Father Jerry as a 
 part of the sermon at both services and they will connect Sundays readings 
 to their experiences of religious life.</span><br><span><br>For more inform
 ation\, visit<span> </span></span><a href="https://www.religiouslifesunday.
 net/" target="_blank">https://www.religiouslifesunday.net/</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Religious Life Sunday
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
