  assisting Father Jerry at the altar </span><i><span>(he needs a lot of hel
 p\, you know)</span></i><span>.<span> </span>The 10am Service is sure to be
  <b><span>VERY interactive</span></b> with Father Jerry asking our students
  questions before the start of the Eucharistic Prayer.<span> </span></span>
 <i><span>It is great fun for children and those young at heart!<span>  </sp
 an></span></i><p><span>Be sure to join us in-person OR via Zoom to particip
 ate\, pray and probably laugh.</span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
