 ated volunteers and supporters. <br>We could not do this important work wit
 hout you.<br><br>Friday\, May 1\, 2026\, 6 p.m. <br>Church of the Holy Spir
 it Lower-Level<br><br>RSVP by April 22.<br><i>There is no cost to attend\, 
 but if you are so inclined\, we will gratefully accept your donation of a b
 ottle of laundry detergent and a can of coffee in a reusable shopping bag.<
 /i>
