 ona</i><u> </u></span><br><u>April 16</u> - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\
 , <i>Glen Ridge</i> [This service will be a Healing Eucharist as it is Holy
  Week.]<br> <br><b><i>Together they devoted themselves to the apostles’ tea
 ching and fellowship\, to the breaking of bread and prayers.</i></b><b> Act
 s 2:42</b><br><b> </b><br>For more information visit: <a href="https://chri
 stchurchepiscopal.org/" target="_blank"><b>https://christchurchepiscopal.or
 g/</b></a><b> OR </b><a href="https://eaccorange.org/" target="_blank"><b>h
