DESCRIPTION:<span>On <b><span>Good Friday</span></b> (April 7) we share bre
 ad from the"reserve sacrament" which was blessed at the Maundy Thursday wor
 ship. At <b><span>8am</span></b> we conclude our over-night vigil with <b><
 span>Morning Prayer</span></b> in our Chapel. </span><br><span> </span><br>
 <span>You may attend this service in-person or via Zoom.</span><span> No bo
 oklet is needed for this service.  </span><span></span><br><p><i><span></sp
 an></i></p><span><p>Via computer/smartphone (ideally with a camera and micr
 ophone):<b><b> <a href="https://zoom.us/j/2010208686"><b>https://zoom.us/j/
 2010208686</b></a></b></b></p><p>Telephone (for audio only): 1 (646) 876 99
 23 - Meeting ID: 201 020 8686</p><p>Email <b><b><a href="mailto:office@holy
 spiritverona.org?subject=Worship%20Password"><b>office@holyspiritverona.org
 </b></a></b></b> for the <b><b>required passcode</b></b>.</p></span>  <span
 ><br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Morning Prayer for Good Friday
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
