DESCRIPTION:DUE TO ONGOING WATER ISSUES IN THE LOWER LEVEL KITCHEN -- NO PA
 NCAKE SUPPER THIS YEAR.<br> <br>===========================================
 ================================= <br> <br>On <b>Tuesday\, February 13\, 20
 24</b> <b>from 5:30-7pm</b> we will host the <b>Mike Carlucci Memorial Panc
 ake Supper</b>. All are invited. We once again name this annual event after
  a long-time parishioner who was the<b> pancake-making chef</b> at this eve
 nt for years and passed away in September 2022. In addition\, in his time a
 t Holy Spirit\, Mike was a Sunday School Teacher\, he preached on several S
 undays during worship\, was on Vestry\, mowed the lawn\, volunteered in our
  Food Pantry\, shopped for inventory for the Food Pantry\, and the list goe
 s on and on<span> </span><br><span> </span><br><span>The cost for the event
  is<b> $10 for adults </b>and <b>$5 for children ages 6-12</b>\;<b> under a
 ge six is free</b>. You may pay at the door or pre-pay on <a href="https://
 www.eservicepayments.com/cgi-bin/Vanco_ver3.vps?appver3=Fi1giPL8kwX_Oe1AO50
 jRiZqwosAhO_mWDnSRn9t9d_HO3iVYxvvxhHjRfLOeq662EvVVAEjqawDomKT1pboucAFyZL5AU
 EYLjKz18ZTy3c=">our website</a> or via Venmo: <span>Holy Spirit Verona @Jer
 ry-Racioppi-2 [6663]​</span>. For more information email <a href="mailto:of
 fice@holyspiritverona.org">office@holyspiritverona.org</a>.<br></span><br><
 span> </span>
