 span></b> on the eve before (<b><span>Saturday\, April 19\, 2025</span></b>
 ) <b><span>at 7:30pm</span></b> when we light the<b><span> new fire</span><
 /b> and experience the move <b><span>from darkness into light</span></b>. T
 he service begins in the center of our outdoor <b><span>labyrinth</span></b
 >\, and then all process into the darkened church where each attendee light
 s a <b><span>candle</span></b> from the new flame.</span></p><p><b><span>St
 ories</span></b><span> of the church through modern times are heard\, and w
 e celebrate <b><span>Eucharist</span></b> once more. After the service join
  us for some <b><span>breads and champagne</span></b> in our Fellowship Hal
 l. <i><span>Jesus Christ is risen today! Alleluia! Alleluia! Alleluia!</spa
 n></i></span></p>
