 wed by a quiet worship service.<br><br><u>February 21</u> – Church of the H
 oly Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <em>Verona</em><br><u>February 28</u> – Epip
 hany and Christ Church\, 105 Main Street\, <em>Orange</em><br><u>March 6</u
 > - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\, <em>Glen Ridge</em><br><u>March 13</u>
  – Church of the Holy Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <em>Verona</em><br><u>Marc
 h 20</u> - Epiphany and Christ Church\, 105 Main Street\, <em>Orange</em><b
 r><u>March 27</u> - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\, <em>Glen Ridge</em> [T
 his service will be a Healing Eucharist as it is Holy Week.]<br> <br><stron
