CREATED:20230130T212616Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>After the Maundy Thursday Worship\, we <strong><span>keep
  vigil</span></strong> inour historic Chapel with an <strong><span>allnight
  watch</span></strong>. The reserve sacrament is present andvisitors may kn
 ock on the red parking lot door if they would like to <strong><span>come an
 d pray</span></strong>.</span><p><span>On the eve before his death Jesus st
 ruggled in the Garden ofGethsemane. He asked his disciples to <strong><span
 >stay awake with him\, keep watchand pray</span></strong>. So\, we do just 
 that until 7am on Good Friday.</span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Over-Night Watch (Vigil) in Historic Chapel
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
