DESCRIPTION:On <b>Tuesday\, March 4\, 2025</b> <b>from 6-7:30pm</b> we will
  host the <b>Mike Carlucci Memorial Pancake Supper</b>. All are invited. We
  once again name this annual event after a long-time parishioner who was th
 e<b> pancake-making chef</b> at this event for years and passed away in Sep
 tember 2022. In addition\, in his time at Holy Spirit\, Mike was a Sunday S
 chool Teacher\, he preached on several Sundays during worship\, was on Vest
 ry\, mowed the lawn\, volunteered in our Food Pantry\, shopped for inventor
 y for the Food Pantry\, and the list goes on and on<span> </span><br><span>
  </span><br><span>The cost for the event is<b> $10 for adults </b>and <b>$5
  for children ages 6-12</b>\;<b> under age six is free</b>. You may pay at 
 the door or pre-pay on <a href="https://www.eservicepayments.com/cgi-bin/Va
 nco_ver3.vps?appver3=Fi1giPL8kwX_Oe1AO50jRiZqwosAhO_mWDnSRn9t9d_HO3iVYxvvxh
 HjRfLOeq662EvVVAEjqawDomKT1pboucAFyZL5AUEYLjKz18ZTy3c=" target="_blank">our
  website</a> or via Venmo: <span>Holy Spirit Verona @Jerry-Racioppi-2 [6663
 ]​</span>. For more information email <a href="mailto:office@holyspiritvero
 na.org" target="_blank">office@holyspiritverona.org</a>.<br></span><br><spa
 n> </span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pancake Supper (Mike Carlucci Memorial)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
