 d 10am Worship Schedule and <b>Coffee Hour</b> following the 10am.<br></spa
 n></span><p><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span>On this day
 \, Sunday\, January 5\, we may be visited by <b><span>Three Kings</span></b
 >\,<b>camels</b> and a Dinosaur. Join us as we celebrate the<span> </span><
 b><span>gifts in our congregation</span></b><span> </span>and sing about a 
 <b>dinosaur</b>. This is also the day you get your <b>STAR WORD</b> for 202
 5.</span></p><p><span> </span></p>
