DESCRIPTION:Beginning November 27\, our Spiritual Enrichment Group (11:45am
  via Zoom) will be studying a series of poems related to Advent and Christm
 as by E.E. Cummings\, the son of a pastor and a thoughtful theologian in hi
 s own right. Cummings’ poems call us to keep awake\, watch\, and wait for G
 od to arrive on Christmas morning. Week by week\, simple candlelight servic
 es and weekly practices will help us read\, reflect\, sing\, and prepare – 
 all for the sake of deepening the joys of the season. For more information 
 and/or a copy of the booklet\, please contact Rev. Katherine or Patti Walsh
 . 
