DESCRIPTION:<span>After the Maundy Thursday Worship\, we <b><span>keep vigi
 l</span></b> in our historic Chapel with an <b><span>all-night watch</span>
 </b>. The reserve sacrament is present and visitors may knock on the red pa
 rking lot door if they would like to <b><span>come and pray</span></b>.</sp
 an><p><span>On the eve before his death Jesus struggled in the Garden of Ge
 thsemane. He asked his disciples to <b><span>stay awake with him\, keep wat
 ch and pray</span></b>. So\, we do just that until 7am on Good Friday.</spa
 n></p>
