UID:13gde0aboofcmamh3p0vhm1gr2@google.com
CREATED:20240904T183332Z
DESCRIPTION:On the following Saturdays (every other week) -- <b>November 2\
 , 16\, 30 and December 14 -- from 9am to 12pm</b> in our Fellowship Hall\, 
 we will host a <b>Centering Prayer Introductory Workshop</b>. Centering Pra
 yer is a form of Contemplative Prayer\, opening our hearts and minds to God
 \, the Ultimate Mystery\, beyond any thoughts\, words and feelings. It is a
  prayer in silence\, which we believe to be God’s first language. This four
 -part workshop will be led by <b>Deacon Joanne O’Neill</b>.<br><b>Sign-up</
 b> in the Fellowship Hall. <i>Plan to attend and bring a friend!</i><br> <b
 r>“Be still and know that I am God.”  <i>Psalm 46:10 ~~ </i>"I am with you 
 always."  <i>Matthew 28:20</i><br> If you have any questions\, or want to j
 oin\, contact <a href="mailto:rector@holyspiritverona.org" target="_blank">
 Father Jerry</a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Centering Prayer Introductory Workshop\, Part 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
