 and one in West Orange will host an Interfaith Thanksgiving Service. The se
 rvice will include scripture readings from Jewish\, Islamic &amp\; Christia
 n traditions\, as well as music related to Thanksgiving with a joint choir 
 from a few of the congregations. A light reception will follow.</span><p></
 p><p><i><span>Questions?</span></i><span> <span> </span>Contact any of the 
 clergy leaders at the participating houses of worship: the <b>First Congreg
 ational Church of Verona\, </b>the <b>First Presbyterian Church of Verona</
 b>\, <b>Our Lady of the Lake Roman Catholic Church</b>\, the<b> Islamic Cen
 ter of Verona</b><span>\,</span><b> </b>the<b> Episcopal Church of the Holy
  Spirit</b><span> and </span><b>B’nai Shalom West Orange</b><span>.</span><
 /span></p>
