DESCRIPTION:<span>The General Convention of The Episcopal Church approved r
 esolution 2022-B004\,<span> </span><strong><b>“Foundation of Religious Life
  Sunday\,”</b></strong><span> </span>to be held each year on the<span> </sp
 an><strong><b>3</b></strong></span><strong><b>rd</b></strong><span><strong>
 <b><span> </span>Sunday of Epiphany</b></strong>. This Sunday focuses effor
 ts to tell all Episcopalians that<span> </span><strong><b>residential monas
 tic and dispersed Christian communities</b></strong><span> </span>exist\, w
 ho we are\, and how to connect with us.</span><br><span><br>We at Holy Spir
 it Verona will hear from both Rev. Katherine and Father Jerry as a part of 
 the sermon at both services and they will connect Sundays readings to their
  experiences of religious life.</span><br><span><br>For more information\, 
 visit<span> </span></span><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www
 .religiouslifesunday.org/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=170425397
 5282496&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0nxq4avMoOkH1OCKmbF3nh" target="_blank">https://www.
 religiouslifesunday.org/</a>
