DESCRIPTION:<span><span><span><b>Beginning Sunday\, February 15</b>\, our <
 b>Spiritual Enrichment Group</b> (<b>at 11:45am via Zoom</b> -- same link a
 s Sunday Worship) will be using a program by Sister Monica Clare\, CSJB ent
 itled<b> "2026 Lenten Meditations: Holy Habits."</b> <a href="https://www.s
 istermonicaclare.com/" target="_blank">Sister Monica</a> is a Transitional 
 Deacon in the Episcopal Diocese of Newark and the Sister Superior at the <a
  href="https://www.csjb.org/" target="_blank">Community of St. John Baptist
 </a> in Mendham\, NJ. </span></span></span><p>She started her TikTok accoun
 t\, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@nunsenseforthepeople?lang=en" target="
 _blank"><u><span><u>@nunsenseforthepeople</u></span></u></a>\, in June 2021
 \, to make people laugh and to demystify life as an Episcopal nun. To her g
 reat surprise\, the popularity of her <b>TikTok</b> channel has continued t
 o grow and she now has over 179K followers and 1.7M likes.</p><span><span><
 span>Join our Spiritual Enrichment Group each week as we reflect on the dai
 ly meditations. Be with us for <b>all seven Sundays (one before Lent\, six 
 in Lent\, including Palm Sunday)</b> or any that work for your schedule. Fo
 r more information and/or a copy of the workbook\, please contact Rev. Kath
 erine\, Father Jerry or Patti Walsh.</span></span></span><br><span><span><s
 pan> </span></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T190653Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spiritual Enrichment Group: Holy Habits
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
