DESCRIPTION:July 29\, 2023 will mark the <b>49th Anniversary of the Priestl
 y Ordination of Women</b> in The Episcopal Church. Holy Spirit Verona will 
 commemorate this and celebrate the <b>"<a href="https://www.episcopalchurch
 .org/glossary/philadelphia-eleven-the/">Philadelphia Eleven</a>"</b> during
  both services on Sunday\, July 30\, 2023. Rev. Katherine Rollo\, Curate\, 
 will Celebrate Eucharist\, and both she and Father Jerry will offer "sermon
 ettes." Special prayers and music will be use to mark this special occasion
 . We are grateful for those who have gone before to pave the way for all.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:49th Anniversary of Ordination of Women in The Episcopal Church
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
