DESCRIPTION:The neighboring Episcopal Church parishes of Christ Church Bloo
 mfield &amp\; Glen Ridge\, Epiphany &amp\; Christ Church Orange and Holy Sp
 irit Verona invite all to share a Lenten journey of fellowship and prayer o
 n the <strong>Wednesday evenings of Lent</strong>. We will meet each <stron
 g>Wednesday at 6:30 pm</strong> for a simple meal of bread and soup\, follo
 wed by a quiet worship service.<br><br><u>February 21</u> – Church of the H
 oly Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <em>Verona</em><br><u>February 28</u> – Epip
 hany and Christ Church\, 105 Main Street\, <em>Orange</em><br><u>March 6</u
 > - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\, <em>Glen Ridge</em><br><u>March 13</u>
  – Church of the Holy Spirit\, 36 Gould Street\, <em>Verona</em><br><u>Marc
 h 20</u> - Epiphany and Christ Church\, 105 Main Street\, <em>Orange</em><b
 r><u>March 27</u> - Christ Church\, 74 Park Avenue\, <em>Glen Ridge</em> [T
 his service will be a Healing Eucharist as it is Holy Week.]<br> <br><stron
 g><em>Together they devoted themselves to the apostles’ teaching and fellow
 ship\, to the breaking of bread and prayers.</em></strong><strong> Acts 2:4
 2</strong><br><strong> </strong><br>For more information visit: <a href="ht
 tps://christchurchepiscopal.org/"><strong>https://christchurchepiscopal.org
 /</strong></a><strong> OR </strong><a href="https://eaccorange.org/"><stron
 g>https://eaccorange.org/</strong></a><strong> OR </strong><a href="https:/
 /www.holyspiritverona.org/"><strong>https://www.holyspiritverona.org/</stro
 ng></a><strong>.</strong>
