DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260511
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:3p6j74sr20ei3ecsmkcq5unht8@google.com
CREATED:20260417T161856Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>We will celebrate <b><span>The Feast of Julian Norwich</s
 pan></b> on <b><span>Sunday\, May 10 </span></b>(even though her actual fea
 st day is May 8). This fourteenth century <b><span>Mystic and Theologian</s
 pan></b> lived in an anchorage in Norwich England during the bubonic plaque
  and has much to teach us today.  Here are the </span><span><a href="https:
 //www.episcopalchurch.org/lectionary/julian-of-norwich/" target="_blank"><s
 pan>scripture readings</span></a></span><span> for her Feast Day and some <
 /span><span><a href="https://www.episcopalchurch.org/glossary/julian-of-nor
 wich/" target="_blank"><span>information</span></a></span><span> about her 
 life.  Join us as we hear of her "Revelations" and gifts to the world.  <i>
 <b><span>#mothersday2026</span></b></i></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T161856Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FEAST OF JULIAN OF NORWICH
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
