DESCRIPTION:On <b>Tuesday\, February 17\, 2026</b> <b>from 6-7:30pm</b> we 
 will host the <b>Mike Carlucci Memorial Pancake Supper</b>. All are invited
 . We once again name this annual event after a long-time parishioner who wa
 s the<b> pancake-making chef</b> at this event for years and passed away in
  September 2022. In addition\, in his time at Holy Spirit\, Mike was a Sund
 ay School Teacher\, he preached on several Sundays during worship\, was on 
 Vestry\, mowed the lawn\, volunteered in our Food Pantry\, shopped for inve
 ntory for the Food Pantry\, and the list goes on and on<span> </span><br><s
 pan> </span><br><span>The cost for the event is<b> $10 for adults </b>and <
 b>$5 for children ages 6-12</b>\;<b> under age six is free</b>. You may pay
  at the door or pre-pay on <a href="https://www.eservicepayments.com/cgi-bi
 n/Vanco_ver3.vps?appver3=Fi1giPL8kwX_Oe1AO50jRiZqwosAhO_mWDnSRn9t9d_HO3iVYx
 vvxhHjRfLOeq662EvVVAEjqawDomKT1pboucAFyZL5AUEYLjKz18ZTy3c=" target="_blank"
 >our website</a> or via Venmo: <span>Holy Spirit Verona @Jerry-Racioppi-2 [
 6663]​</span>. For more information email <a href="mailto:office@holyspirit
 verona.org" target="_blank">office@holyspiritverona.org</a>.<br></span><br>
 <span> </span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
