BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251110
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:cdhj4e1i68rj4b9g6crjgb9k61hj2b9p6kpj6bb46tgj8c1l6srmaopkcc@google.com
CREATED:20250612T192939Z
DESCRIPTION:At Holy Spirit Verona we share in <b><b>three weeks of &quot\;P
 re-Advent&quot\;</b></b> -- the three Sundays between All Saints and Advent
  1. During this time we encourage you to take an intentional “pause” before
  the waiting and preparing of Advent. Advent used to be seven weeks\, up un
 til the 7<span>th</span> century\, and there is a small movement within the
  Church to return to that (see <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http:/
 /www.theadventproject.org/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=17278975
 91007990&amp\;usg=AOvVaw38z0-bDTkQCl2wHNd4NKVY" target="_blank"><b>theadven
 tproject.org</b></a>). Many of the scripture readings and prayers after All
  Saints give a hint or lean towards Advent\, so Father Jerry says...<span> 
 </span><i><i>why not just go there!</i></i><p>Yes\, we all know Father Jerr
 y loves Advent. We are not bringing forth Christmas early like many retaile
 rs do\, but rather allowing <b><b>an intentional time to PAUSE</b></b> befo
 re the all-consuming month of December. These three weeks of Pre-Advent\, w
 e hope\, will bring forth a level of preparation and space during Advent wh
 ich will make Christmas that much more meaningful. Our first experience of 
 Pre-Advent was in 2018\, so it&#39\;s now officially a tradition! We get to
  see the blue hangings\, which are symbolic of the Blessed Mother\, for jus
 t a few extra weeks. <b><b>Find some space</b></b> these next three weeks t
 o do something that will set you up well for the entrance of the Christ-chi
 ld into our midst yet again.<i><i> Join us as we prepare to prepare!</i></i
 ></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PRE-ADVENT BEGINS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
