UID:3dlankmp0n9o5743dcges0h0sk@google.com
CREATED:20230517T155225Z
DESCRIPTION:On <b>Sunday\, May 21 at both the 8am and the 10am</b>\, we wil
 l have a <b>Guest Preacher: Scott Chesney</b>. <span>Scott Chesney is a mot
 ivational speaker\, life coach\, and consultant who has spoken to over 1.5 
 million people in 43 countries. Since awakening to paralysis at the age of 
 15\, Scott has lived an extraordinary life full of passion\, purpose\, and 
 service to others that is captured in “Ride the Wave\,” a documentary about
  Scott’s life that was released worldwide in 2020. Currently\, Scott reside
 s in Verona\, NJ with his wife and two children. For additional information
  on Scott\, visit <a href="http://scottchesney.com">scottchesney.com</a>.</
 span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115427Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SCOTT CHESNEY PREACHES AT BOTH SERVICES
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
