CREATED:20240927T194040Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>On Sunday\, October 13\, we kick off our<b><span> Steward
 ship Campaign</span></b>.<span> </span>This is the time of year when we eac
 h <b><span>recommit</span></b> our <b><span>time\, talent and treasure </sp
 an></b>to the Holy Spirit Community.<span> </span>This year’s theme <b><spa
 n>"Walk in Love" </span></b>is an opportunity to be <b><span>reminded of ho
 w everything we do\, we do in God's love.</span></b><span> </span>We show o
 ur thanks by </span><i><b><span>sharing that love</span></b></i><span> with
  each other and the world.</span><p><span>We are each encouraged to discern
  how we see God's love in our daily lives.<span> </span>How can I share God
 's love with those around me?<span> </span>Where do I see God's love in thi
 s community and how do I share that love with Holy Spirit Verona and beyond
 ? </span></p><p><u><span>Stewardship 2024-25 Timeline</span></u><span>:</sp
 an></p><p><span>Sundays\, October 13 - November 24 -<b><span> Stewardship I
 nserts </span></b>in Sunday Bulletin (or online)</span></p><p><span>Sunday\
 , October 13 - <b><span>Kick-Off</span></b>/ </span><span><b><span><a href=
 "https://www.holyspiritverona.org/uploads/1/4/2/4/142411498/stewardshipform
 s2024_final.pdf" target="_blank">Re-Commitment Forms</a></span></b></span><
 span> Available (electronically and in Church)</span></p><p><span>Sundays\,
  October 27\, November 10\, 17 &amp\; 24 - <b><span>stories of members</spa
 n></b> shared at10am worship</span></p><p><span>Sunday\, November 24 - <b><
 span>In-Giving</span></b> Sunday / <b><span>Re-Commitment Forms Returned</s
 pan></b></span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T115350Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:STEWARDSHIP 2024-25 KICK-OFF
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
