DESCRIPTION:Holy Spirit Verona hosts<b><b> Friday BINGO Fund Raisers</b></b
 > each month (this month on the THIRD Friday)\; doors open and BINGO cards 
 go on sale at 6pm. Entrance fee (with sheets for ten games) is<span> </span
 ><b><b>$20</b></b>\; the first number is called at 7pm. Snacks and beverage
 s will be available for purchase\, and you are welcome to bring your own fo
 od. No alcohol is allowed and you must be 18 years old to play BINGO. <p><b
 ><b>Additional set of sheets may be purchased for $15</b></b> and extra she
 ets for our cover-all game (Game #10) can be purchased for $5.</p>
