STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BINGO Fund Raiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20230924
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20230925
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=12;BYDAY=-1SU
DTSTAMP:20260727T041448Z
UID:7k7nsgkf7pe73sgajfefiap0mi@google.com
CREATED:20230824T220049Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Often worshipers are asked to put away their devices duri
 ng worship service\, but you won’t hear that on <b><span>Social Media Sunda
 y\, the last Sunday in September</span></b>.<span> </span><i>Why?</i><span>
 <i> </i></span>Because Jesus said so in Sunday's Gospel!<span> </span>Jesus
  reminds us to not "stand idle all day\;" so therefore\, use the tools we h
 ave in 2023 to connect Holy Spirit with the world outside our four walls --
  <i>via Social Media!</i><span><i> </i></span><b><span>People need to be to
 ld the Good News multiple times in multiple ways</span></b>:in person\, Fac
 ebook\, Instagram\, website\, letter\, etc. Each of us must <b><span>share 
 the Good News!</span></b></span><p><span>In 2023\, our <b><span>communicati
 on options include social media</span></b>.<span> </span>With over 2.3 bill
 ion users of social media* around the globe and 1million new social mobile 
 users added each day*\, going into the world to <b><span>share good news </
 span></b>requires <b><span>using new tools </span></b>to reach people where
  they are.</span></p><span>*Social Media statistics found here: </span><spa
 n><a href="http://bit.ly/2c9F6wR"><span>http://bit.ly/2c9F6wR</span></a></s
 pan><span> <br><br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T190653Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SOCIAL MEDIA SUNDAY
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
