 icrophone): <a href="https://zoom.us/j/2010208686" target="_blank">https://
 zoom.us/j/2010208686</a><br>Telephone (for audio only): 1 (646) 876 9923 - 
 Meeting ID: 201 020 8686  <span>- Participant ID = # (not applicable).</spa
 n><br><br>Email <a href="mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org" target="_blank
 ">office@holyspiritverona.org</a> for the <b>required passcode</b>.<br><br>
 For a copy of our <b>Sunday Worship Booklet and Scripture Insert</b>\, <a h
 ref="https://www.holyspiritverona.org/worship-booklet-and-scripture-reading
 s.html" target="_blank">click here</a>.<br><br>A full worship service with 
 music.<br><br>Our 10am service can also be viewed Live (or after the fact) 
 on our <a href="https://www.facebook.com/holyspiritverona/" target="_blank"
 >Facebook page</a>.
