 pen and BINGO cards go on sale at 6pm. Entrance fee (with sheets for ten ga
 mes) is<span> </span><b><b>$20</b></b>\; the first number is called at 7pm.
  Snacks and beverages will be available for purchase\, and you are welcome 
 to bring your own food. No alcohol is allowed and you must be 18 years old 
 to play BINGO. <p><b><b>Additional set of sheets may be purchased for $15</
 b></b> and extra sheets for our cover-all game (Game #10) can be purchased 
 for $5.</p>
