DESCRIPTION:<span>It has been two and a half years since our Diocesan Bisho
 p visited Holy Spirit\, so on <b><span>Sunday\, September 27</span></b>\, <
 b><span>the Right Rev. Carlye J. Hughes will preach and celebrate at our 10
 am service</span></b>\, meet with the congregation after the service\, and 
 then conclude her visit with a lunch (in the lower level) with the Vestry a
 nd our Thrift Shop Manager. To learn more about the Diocese\, take a look a
 t </span><span><a href="https://dioceseofnewark.org/bishops-vlog" target="_
 blank"><b><span>Bishop Hughes' vlog</span></b></a></span><span> (video blog
 ). </span><span>We look forward to welcoming Bishop Hughes back to our comm
 unity.</span>
