CREATED:20221110T035315Z
DESCRIPTION:Each Sunday\, our 8am service is available<b><b> online via Zoo
 m</b></b> OR you<b><b> may attend in-person</b></b> in the Chapel. This Sun
 day we'll be<b> in the Fellowship Hall</b> due to our lower-level waterproo
 fing project.<br><p>Via computer/smartphone (ideally with a camera and micr
 ophone):<b><b> <a href="https://zoom.us/j/2010208686" target="_blank"><b>ht
 tps://zoom.us/j/2010208686</b></a></b></b></p><p>Telephone (for audio only)
 : 1 (646) 876 9923 - Meeting ID: 201 020 8686</p><p>Email <b><b><a href="ma
 ilto:office@holyspiritverona.org?subject=Worship%20Password" target="_blank
 "><b>office@holyspiritverona.org</b></a></b></b> for the <b><b>required pas
 scode</b></b>.</p><p>For a copy of our <b><b>Sunday Worship Booklet and Scr
 ipture Insert\, <a href="https://www.holyspiritverona.org/worship-booklet-a
 nd-scripture-readings.html" target="_blank"><b>click here</b></a></b></b>.<
 /p><p>A contemplative service in our historic All Saints Chapel. The Worshi
 p (about 40 minutes) includes <b><b>silence and Taize chants</b></b> as we 
 praise God early on a Sunday morning.</p><p>"Be still and know that I am Go
 d." - Psalm 46:10</p><p> </p><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T190653Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Quiet Eucharist online or in-person in Fellowship Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
